# Licensed art (tilesets, character sheets, item icons) — bought on your own
# account, added at deploy time, NEVER committed. This repo is public; see
# ASSETS.md before touching anything under these paths. Our OWN map.json /
# map.tmx (authored in Tiled, phase 04) is NOT covered by this and should be
# committed normally — only the image binaries are excluded here.
client/public/assets/**/*.png
client/public/assets/**/*.jpg
client/public/assets/**/*.jpeg
!client/public/assets/**/.gitkeep
client/src/images/**/*.png
!client/src/images/**/.gitkeep
# Self-made TEMP placeholders (not third-party art) — see README, phase 03 replaces these.
!client/src/images/logo.png
!client/src/images/login/*_login.png
